{"parse": {"title": "BTE-02", "pageid": 25629, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/BTE-01\" title=\"BTE-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">BTE-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/BTE-03\" title=\"BTE-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">BTE</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.BB.91.E6.9E.97.E7.A7.81.E8.AF.AD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"黑林私语\">黑林私语</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 黑林私语</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Whispers in Black Forest</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>密<span class=\"color-value\"></span>林<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>篝<span class=\"color-value\"></span>火<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>许<span class=\"color-value\"></span>多<span class=\"color-value\"></span>轻<span class=\"color-value\"></span>巧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>而<span class=\"color-value\"></span>莽<span class=\"color-value\"></span>撞<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>朋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>友<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 190602</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"xuexiaotushuguan\"><img alt=\"xuexiaotushuguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/600px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/900px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/1200px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十四行诗站在顶光下，将手中的文字轻缓地读出声来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>“1912年，诗人被定以‘侮辱最高当局’罪名，押送至东西伯利亚，随后通过转运监狱，流放孤岛。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>“此后十余年，定居于此……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>“与岛屿上的动物……诗歌……形影不离……”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>林中，冬正坐在空地的岩石上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>许多动物环绕着他。此处，俨然一个小型的森林集会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>——<i>“对不可相信的话，请别相信”</i><br /><br /><i>“对不可触碰之物，请别伸手”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身边，棕熊抬起厚实的手掌，搭到他举着羊皮纸的小臂上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>先生，请别伸手……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>这里，不该停顿。韵脚会乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>咳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div><i>“对不可后悔的路，请别回头”</i><br /><br /><i>“铁翅对猎人，如此告诫”</i><br /><br /><i>“可这猎人，轻信且贪婪”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>左边，铅灰色的狐狸不满地衔住他的衣袖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>请认真些，先听完……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>——<i>“不得所求”</i><br /><br /><i>“便妄图抹杀所有”</i><br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑貂亲热地围着他的脖子，窃窃私语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>……是的。您说得对。这位猎人先生，简直无药可救。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>并且……恐怕现在，仍有这样的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>愿他们，自食其果……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>融洽的景象中，站在身后，驯鹿轻轻摇晃巨大的双角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一些反对意见的苗头，险些把诗人从岩石上晃了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>啊，小姐……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>我，咳咳。我明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>但您说，猎人，也只是为了生存……这我……我不能同意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>是虚荣，使他拒绝空手而归，不是饥饿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>鸽子的腹中，真的会有宝石吗？它所站的枝桠，也承受不起，呃，一个男子的重量……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>猎人，要迫害鸽子，鸽子却告诫他；跌落进雪地，雪地也接纳他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>真是……宽容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>对呀，这令我、想起……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div><i><span style=\"font-size:116%\">“我们怎能不爱人间，更胜过天堂？”</span></i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>自然，是人间的远景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>我们像盆栽……被放置其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>山雀从远处飞来，稳当、准确地落在他肩膀上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惊喜，亲昵，一对久违的友人。 </div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>我的朋友！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>你似乎去了，太久。我快以为你，是落入了哪……哪个猎人的陷阱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>动物们几乎立刻便警戒起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>虽然，这里并没有什么，“猎人”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>只有我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>山雀却摇头，吱吱喳喳，模样并不畅快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它看上去急切地需要来自朋友的全部注意力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>你说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>什……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-301302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冬：</div><div>……不，我，咳！咳咳。我得，走了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这消息令他浑身震悚，手中稿纸散落一地，甚至来不及捡拾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冬跳下岩石，踏灭了篝火，随即往针叶林的更深处躲去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“朋友们”，当然也随他跑走。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“据诗人本人描述，岛上的岁月伴随着‘苦寒，与忠诚的朋友’。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>“‘很多朋友……’”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩思索着，视线停留在档案上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“而这段平静岁月，至少持续到20年代中叶。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“直到当局的人类记者踏上了这片极东的土地。”</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "BTE-02"}}